Short:        24bit to HAM8 c2p routine v1.0
Author:       xvavra1@br.fjfi.cvut.cz
Uploader:     xvavra1 br fjfi cvut cz
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos


FEATURES

-	cpu-only, no blitter usage
-       full multitasking support
-       proposed for using on intution screens(HAM8), double buffering
-	68020 optimized
-       long words written to CHIPRAM
-       RUNS AT *ANY* SCREENMODE THAT SUPPORTS PLANNAR HAM8 AND DBUFFERING
-       runs at almost any window size
-       changeable pixel size  1x1 1x2 2x1 2x2
-       linear, line-based -> you dont need to have whole 24bit buffer in ram
-	freeware

FUTURE

-	speed up
-	PPC version (maybe)
-	more clever 24bit to ham8 conversion (dynamic palette handling)


